   <outcomes>
 
    <ul>
      <li><p>How do we think about the determinant of a 2x2 matrix algebraically?</p></li>
      <li><p>
        What is co-factor expansion for?
      </p> </li>
      <li><p>How do we apply cofactor expansion?</p></li>
    </ul>
  </outcomes>


</worksheet>
